Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.56,0:01:27.39,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}保護著凍僵的你的
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.48,0:01:32.44,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}是與他所構築的種種回憶
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.48,0:01:37.24,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}在這小小的手掌之中
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.40,0:01:42.33,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}我要緊緊地  緊緊地  緊緊地
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.58,0:01:46.25,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}將未來抓住
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.16,0:01:51.04,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}看啊  雨後的天空
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.21,0:01:53.55,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}架起了一道彩虹
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.63,0:01:57.05,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}這樣的日子一定會來到
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.13,0:02:00.93,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}現在跪倒不起的你也會如同那天空
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.05,0:02:03.14,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}無論多少次
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.22,0:02:07.06,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}都一定能綻放出光彩
